# Customizing Individual Bar Colors

```elixir
Mix.install([
  {:plotly_ex, "~> 0.3"},
  {:kino, "~> 0.18"}
])
```

## Section

Pass a list of colors to `marker.color` to assign a different color to
each bar individually.

```elixir
alias Plotly.{Figure, Bar}

Figure.new()
|> Figure.add_trace(
  Bar.new(
    x: ["Feature A", "Feature B", "Feature C", "Feature D", "Feature E"],
    y: [20, 14, 23, 25, 22],
    marker: %{
      color: [
        "rgba(204, 204, 204, 1)",
        "rgba(222, 45, 38, 0.8)",
        "rgba(204, 204, 204, 1)",
        "rgba(204, 204, 204, 1)",
        "rgba(204, 204, 204, 1)"
      ]
    }
  )
)
|> Figure.update_layout(
  title: "Least Used Feature",
  xaxis: %{title: "Feature"},
  yaxis: %{title: "Usage"}
)
|> Plotly.show()
```
